 "text": "Listen, y'all have seen these camera finders everywhere, but nobody shows you the part that matters. Let's be for real. A tiny lens can hide in a smoke detector or even the shower head. So turn it on, the red lights flash, and you look through this little window. A hidden lens shines right back at you as a bright red dot. At night, hang it on the door handle, and if anybody moves that door, it goes off. It even has a flashlight for when you get up in the dark. Once you have it, you'll be checking every bathroom you walk into. Holiday trips are coming up, so grab two, one for you and one for your bestie. I linked it in the orange cart for you",
